DESCRIPTION:Nema Katt is what happens when real life gets a microphone.Born
  and raised in Dallas\, Texas\, and now based in Atlanta\, Georgia\, Nema b
 rings an unapologetic combination of intelligence\, authenticity\, edge\, a
 nd Texas attitude to every stage she touches. Her comedy dives fearlessly i
 nto the realities of marriage\, modern dating\, breastfeeding\, motherhood\
 , medical school\, relationships\, and everything people are usually thinki
 ng but may be too afraid to say out loud. Nema’s ability to turn her own 
 life experiences into hilarious\, relatable stories gives audiences the fee
 ling that they aren’t just watching a comedian—they’re catching up wi
 th the funniest friend in the room. Nema has shared stages and toured with 
 some of comedy’s most respected names\, including Mike Epps\, Mark Curry\
 , Faizon Love\, and Ali Siddiq\, and has opened for legendary comedian Paul
  Mooney. Her comedy journey has also taken her to one of entertainment’s 
 most iconic stages\, the Apollo Theater in Harlem. Beyond stand-up\, Nema i
 s an actress and entertainer who starred in the stage play and movie When A
  Man Knows \, further showcasing her versatility as a performer. Smart. Unf
 iltered. Relatable. Unapologetic.\n\nNema Katt doesn’t just tell jokes—
 she tells the stories you didn’t know you were allowed to laugh about.\n\
